sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Accountant
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant Policy
  participant Advisor
  participant Gemini
  Accountant->>UI: Request explanation in supported context
  UI->>API: Authenticated advisory request
  API->>Policy: Synthetic authorization, quota, budget, kill switch
  Policy->>Advisor: Allowlisted synthetic projection if permitted
  Advisor->>Gemini: Bounded ADK invocation
  Gemini->>Advisor: Structured untrusted output
  Advisor->>API: Validate evidence references or safe fallback
  API->>Accountant: Advice only; no automatic workflow consumption
